§§ `Part 9.4AAA -- whistleblowers`

#ASSERT `Am I an eligible whistleblower` `a company` `an employee` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I an eligible whistleblower` `a trading or financial corporation` `I supply services or goods to it, paid or unpaid` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I an eligible whistleblower` `an ADI, its authorised NOHC or a subsidiary of either` `a relative of a person in one of those groups` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I an eligible whistleblower` `a company` `no such connection` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I an eligible whistleblower` `none of these` `an employee` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Am I an eligible whistleblower` `a company` `a trustee, custodian or investment manager of the superannuation entity, or an officer, employee or supplier of one` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I an eligible whistleblower` `a superannuation entity or its trustee` `a trustee, custodian or investment manager of the superannuation entity, or an officer, employee or supplier of one` EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- s 1317AAD(1)(b): earlier disclosure on 1 January 2026; 90 days have passed on 2 April 2026.
#ASSERT `When is the earliest I can make a public interest disclosure` (`d` 1 1 2026) EQUALS `d` 2 4 2026

`PID` MEANS `a public interest disclosure`
`ED` MEANS `an emergency disclosure`
`Q1` MEANS `it qualifies: a disclosure to ASIC, APRA or a prescribed authority (s 1317AA(1))`
`Q2` MEANS `it qualifies: a disclosure to an eligible recipient (s 1317AA(2))`
`Q3` MEANS `it qualifies: a disclosure to a lawyer (s 1317AA(3))`
`Q4` MEANS `it qualifies: a public interest disclosure (s 1317AAD(1))`
`Q5` MEANS `it qualifies: an emergency disclosure (s 1317AAD(2))`
`no` MEANS `it does not qualify for protection on these facts`
`MP` MEANS `a member of an Australian parliament or a journalist`

-- Inside disclosures.
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `ASIC` TRUE FALSE FALSE `PID` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` `any day` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `Q1`
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `APRA` TRUE FALSE FALSE `PID` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` `any day` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `Q1`
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `an eligible recipient of the entity` TRUE FALSE FALSE `PID` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` `any day` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `Q2`
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` FALSE `ASIC` TRUE FALSE FALSE `PID` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` `any day` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no`
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `ASIC` FALSE FALSE FALSE `PID` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` `any day` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no`
-- A purely personal work-related grievance is carved out, unless it is about victimisation of the discloser.
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `an eligible recipient of the entity` TRUE TRUE FALSE `PID` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` `any day` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no`
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `an eligible recipient of the entity` TRUE TRUE TRUE `PID` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` `any day` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `Q2`
-- A lawyer: no other condition, even for a grievance and a person who is not an eligible whistleblower.
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` FALSE `a legal practitioner, for advice or representation about the whistleblower protections` FALSE TRUE FALSE `PID` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` `any day` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `Q3`
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `someone else` TRUE FALSE FALSE `PID` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` `any day` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no`
-- Public interest disclosure: earlier disclosure 1 January 2026, notice 2 April, disclosure 3 April.
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `MP` TRUE FALSE FALSE `PID` TRUE (`d` 1 1 2026) TRUE (`d` 2 4 2026) (`d` 3 4 2026) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `Q4`
-- Notice on 1 April 2026, a day too early.
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `MP` TRUE FALSE FALSE `PID` TRUE (`d` 1 1 2026) TRUE (`d` 1 4 2026) (`d` 3 4 2026) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no`
-- Grounds to believe action is being taken.
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `MP` TRUE FALSE FALSE `PID` TRUE (`d` 1 1 2026) TRUE (`d` 2 4 2026) (`d` 3 4 2026) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no`
-- More disclosed than necessary.
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `MP` TRUE FALSE FALSE `PID` TRUE (`d` 1 1 2026) TRUE (`d` 2 4 2026) (`d` 3 4 2026) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no`
-- Disclosed to the journalist before the written notice.
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `MP` TRUE FALSE FALSE `PID` TRUE (`d` 1 1 2026) TRUE (`d` 5 4 2026) (`d` 3 4 2026) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no`
-- Emergency disclosure: no waiting period.
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `MP` TRUE FALSE FALSE `ED` TRUE (`d` 1 1 2026) TRUE (`d` 2 1 2026) (`d` 2 1 2026) FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `Q5`
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `MP` TRUE FALSE FALSE `ED` FALSE (`d` 1 1 2026) TRUE (`d` 2 1 2026) (`d` 2 1 2026) FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `no`
#ASSERT `Does my disclosure qualify for protection` TRUE `MP` TRUE FALSE FALSE `ED` TRUE (`d` 1 1 2026) FALSE (`d` 2 1 2026) (`d` 2 1 2026) FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `no`

